tyle:{"--framer-text-alignment":`left`},children:`I oversaw every aspect of the redesign, from site architecture and content strategy to interaction design and visual identity. The goal was to create more than just a marketing site—it needed to be a compelling and dynamic tool that clearly communicated Flite’s value to prospective customers.`}),i(`p`,{className:`framer-styles-preset-1b1wlt8`,"data-styles-preset":`yywA2ZNZg`,style:{"--framer-text-alignment":`left`,"--framer-text-color":`var(--token-0f0ae4b9-e928-41c5-b457-bbd33ae176d3, rgb(89, 89, 89))`},children:i(`br`,{className:`trailing-break`})}),o(`p`,{className:`framer-styles-preset-1b1wlt8`,"data-styles-preset":`yywA2ZNZg`,style:{"--framer-text-alignment":`left`},children:[`I streamlined the messaging to make complex technology more accessible, introduced high-quality visuals and interactive elements to showcase Flite’s real-time creative capabilities, and refined the site’s navigation for an intuitive, engaging experience. The redesign also featured\xA0`,i(`strong`,{children:`full-frame imagery and a bold visual system`}),`, reinforcing Flite’s position as a leader in creative ad management.`]})]}),className:`framer-fdkq8s`,"data-framer-name":`Paragraph`,fonts:[`Inter`,`Inter-Bold`],verticalAlignment:`top`,withExternalLayout:!0})}),i(g,{children:i(P,{__framer__animate:{transition:H},__framer__animateOnce:!0,__framer__enter:K,__framer__exit:q,__framer__styleAppearEffectEnabled:!0,__framer__threshold:0,__perspectiveFX:!1,__targetOpacity:1,className:`framer-vgzpze-container`,isAuthoredByUser:!0,isModuleExternal:!0,nodeId:`JOkk2NbjK`,rendersWithMotion:!0,scopeId:`GZ20qtGQC`,style:{transformPerspective:1200},children:i(D,{alt:`Sample project image`,height:`100%`,id:`JOkk2NbjK`,image:J({pixelHeight:1744,pixelWidth:2716,src:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/pCGx6RTCwPV1zGURDfSB4fOFU.jpg`,srcSet:`https://framerusercontent.com/images/pCGx6RTCwPV1zGURDfSB4fOFU.jpg?scale-down-to=512 512w,https://framerusercontent.c